Subject: [PATCH] fpm_sre.c: move the adapt store after mag_avg (issue 58 SRE candidate)

Recovered experimental representative sre-order-004 from the issue 58 FPM
store-order domain. See docs/issue58-fpm.md. NOT a validated change:
EXACT iff mag_avg precedes adapt, which distinguishes an ordering fact,
not a unique total source order. Apply from the repo root with git apply.

--- a/src/dsp/fpm_sre.c
+++ b/src/dsp/fpm_sre.c
@@ -64,11 +64,11 @@
 
 	sre->active = 0;
 	sre->acquiring = 1;
-	sre->adapt = 1;
 	sre->mode = 0;
 	sre->pll_acc = 0;
 	sre->err_avg = 0;
 	sre->mag_avg = 0;
+	sre->adapt = 1;
 	sre->taps = (short)(sre->cfg.coeffs / FPM_SRE_BRANCHES);
 	sre->fill = 0;
 	sre->acc_x = 0;
